	(text "48 fitted = 480 uF nominal; approximately 160 uF typical at 42 V before tolerances.\nSix optional positions add 60 uF nominal. This bank replaces C101-C103 electrolytics.\nValidate cable resonance, regeneration, ripple heating and transient margin on hardware."
